OL,3,GNEWSA#200k frozen in probe into illegal
OL,4,A'skinny jabs'
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than #200,000 has been frozen in
OL,7,Fbank accounts as part of an ongoing
OL,8,Foperation by the UK's medicines
OL,9,Fwatchdog targeting illegal weight-loss
OL,10,Fjabs, a BBC investigation has found.
OL,12,FThe three accounts affected are all
OL,13,Flinked to Alluvi Healthcare, whose
OL,14,Fbranding appeared on all of the seized
OL,15,Fproducts.
OL,17,FOrders to freeze the accounts were made
OL,18,Fat Northampton Magistrates' Court
OL,19,Ffollowing an application from the
OL,20,FMedicines and Healthcare products
OL,21,FRegulatory Agency (MHRA) under the
OL,22,FProceeds of Crime Act.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
